---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: locales
  size: 1
  alias: lang
permalink: "{{ '' if lang == 'ko' else 'en/' }}about/history/index.html"
title: 연혁
description: 주식회사 하이탑의 설립부터 특허 등록, 조달청 나라장터 등록, G-PASS 인증까지의 발자취입니다.
bodyClass: bg-surface text-ink
---

<section class="relative mt-20 h-[36vh] min-h-[280px] max-h-[380px] overflow-hidden bg-night">
  <img src="{{ '/images/hero/about-hero.webp' | lurl }}" alt="{{ '교량 구조와 기반시설을 표현한 이미지' | t }}"
       class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_54%]" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-night/45"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-night/75 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container-hi relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-9 text-white sm:pb-11">
    <nav aria-label="{{ '브레드크럼' | t }}" class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-white/60">
      <a href="{{ '/' | lurl }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">{{ "홈" | t }}</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <a href="{{ '/about/' | lurl }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-white">{{ "회사소개" | t }}</a>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
      <span aria-current="page" class="text-white/90">{{ "연혁" | t }}</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-line !text-white/60">History</span>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white [text-shadow:0_2px_18px_rgba(11,14,19,0.45)] sm:text-4xl">{{ "연혁" | t }}</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container-hi">
  <div class="grid items-end gap-7 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <span class="eyebrow-line">Milestones</span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">{{ "설립 이후 걸어온 길" | t }}</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="border-t border-ink/15 pt-5 leading-relaxed text-secondary lg:col-span-5">
      {{ "특허 등록과 조달청 나라장터 등록, 생산 설비 확장을 거치며 교량이음장치·논슬립·목재덱 전 품목의 공급 체계를 갖추었습니다." | t }}
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="history-layout">
    {# Decorative photograph: Jonathan Cooper / Unsplash; not a HITOP project. #}
    <div class="history-photo" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="{{ '/images/hero/history-bridge.jpg' | lurl }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
    </div>

  {% set milestones = {
    "2020": { label: "하이탑의 시작" },
    "2021": { label: "공공 조달 진입" },
    "2022": { label: "독자 기술 확보" },
    "2023": { label: "기술 경쟁력 강화" },
    "2024": { label: "생산 기반 확대" },
    "2025": { label: "제품 포트폴리오 확장" },
    "2026": { label: "해외 조달을 향한 도약" }
  } %}
  <ol class="history-timeline" aria-label="{{ '연도별 주요 연혁' | t }}">
    {% for h in company.history %}
      {% set milestone = milestones[h.year] %}
      <li class="history-entry{% if loop.last %} history-entry-latest{% endif %}">
        <span class="history-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h3 class="history-year">{{ h.year }}</h3>
        <p class="history-label">{{ (milestone.label or "주요 발자취") | t }}</p>
        <ul class="history-events">
          {% for it in h.items %}
            <li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
              <span class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span>{{ it | t | keepPatentNo | safe }}</span>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaTitle = "하이탑의 기술력이 궁금하신가요?" %}
{% set ctaDesc = "등록 특허와 공식 인증 내역을 함께 확인해 보세요." %}
{% set ctaSecondary = { label: "산업재산권 및 인증 보기", url: "/about/certifications/" } %}
{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
